  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SweDev - Swedish Development Research Network</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SweDev - Swedish Development Research Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Swedish Environment Institute (SEI) f&#xf6;r etablering av Swedish Development Research Network (SweDev) som syftar till att st&#xe4;rka utvecklingsforskningen i Sverige och att &#xf6;ka relevansen av utvecklingsrelaterad forskning f&#xf6;r att bidra till policyutveckling och beslutsfattande och svenska akt&#xf6;rers arbete med utvecklingsfr&#xe5;gor (Agenda 2030).

St&#xf6;det innefattar finansiering f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja etablering av n&#xe4;tverket och dess verksamhet ( grundl&#xe4;ggande infrastruktur, aktiviteter och administration). SEI kommer att fungera som v&#xe4;rd / sekretariat f&#xf6;r n&#xe4;tverket och SweDev kommer att f&#xf6;lja SEI: s financiella system och rutiner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Swedish Environment Institute (SEI) for the establishment of a Swedish Development Research Network (SweDev), which aims to strengthen development research in Sweden and to increase the relevance of evidence-based development research for efficient policy-making and practice among Swedish actors working for Agenda 2030. 

The contribution includes support the setting-up of the network, both in terms of the basic infrastructure, activities and administration. SEI will function as a host/secretariat for the network. In legal terms SweDev is thus a project hosted by the SEI and will as such follow financial management procedures of SEI.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The purpose of SweDev is to strengthen links between development researchers based in Sweden as well as between development research, policy and practice. The network aims to strengthen the collaborations amongst development researchers in Sweden and to increase the relevance and use of development research for efficient policymaking and practice among Swedish actors working for the 2030 Agenda.
To reach the overall objectives SweDev network seeks to:1. Improve multi-disciplinary connections and exploration of synergetic effects among Swedish development researchers2. Increase the use of research-based knowledge in policies and practices3. Strengthen the connections between development research, policy, and practice</narrative>
  </description>
